{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>זבדני אלהים.</b> Like the meaning \"He has given me a portion,\" and it has no parallel in Scripture." "<b>יזבלני.</b> יזבול עמי — His dwelling will be with me always, like \"I have built a house of זבול for You\" (1 Kings 8:13). And like it, \"בני יצאוני\" (Jeremiah 10:20) — they have gone out from me; \"ויבואני\" (Psalms 119:41) — all of them are intransitive verbs."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:22.747493624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}